us Drac, stripped of their old powers, it\u2019s up to you to become your best bloodthirsty self. Vanquish goons with iconic weapons, elementals, bats, and even Medusa\u2019s &quot;headouken!&quot; on the road to your victorious rampage in this side-scrolling platformer.",
